    "directions": [
      "Firstly take 10-12 chicken wings and trim the bones and pull the meat towards down so thatâs you get a pocket.",
      "In a mixing bowl add Bread crumbs, Red chilli paste, ed cheese and mix well.",
      "Fill the chicken wings pocket with the stuffing in it.",
      "In a mixing bowl add Egg, ginger garlic paste, white pepper powder and mix it well and marinate the stuffed chicken and keep it aside for 20- 25 minutes.",
      "To the same remaining marinade mixture, add corn starch, refined flour, red chilli powder, garam masala, salt and oil mix it well and make a batter out of it.",
      "To prepare a seasoning flour, In an another mixing bowl add Refined flour, white pepper, cornstarch and salt to taste and mix well.",
      "Now roll the stuffed chicken into the seasoned flour first, coat evenly and then into the batter.",
      "Take a deep kadai for frying. Once the oil is heated on medium flame, fry the chicken lollipops until it gets golden brown in colour.",
      "Serve hot with chilli sauce."
